resentativeness":0.9099423885345459,"text_excerpt":"Such an amazing B&B in an AWESOME spot. Just a five minute walk to the French Quarter and all the bus lines. Service, breakfast, and recommendations were all on point. Next time we come to New Orleans, we'll be staying here!"},{"business_id":"GOIDwFvl8JoUKP3G0tyFPg","review_id":"G01ttlYnrTgju-0PclyE1g","date":"2011-07-19T16:35:40","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9023284912109375,"text_excerpt":"Breakfast was yummy and the conversation was mutually engaging. Kevin and Rob did an excellent job in making our vacation wonderful. My other and I aren't married but it feels like we are on a honeymoon! Rob gave us wonderful and useful pointers on places to see and things to do. I hope we can make this a yearly trip and stay here again."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
